# Each time it becomes the target is its own trigger (CR 603.2): Bot2's two Lightning Bolts draw two cards. Each Bolt's
# trigger goes on the stack above it and resolves first, so both draws happen while Ruric Thar is still on the battlefield;
# the second Bolt is the lethal one (six damage marked on a 4/6) and it dies after them.

